299
00:07:54,210 --> 00:07:56,090
No drive, no copay.

300
00:07:56,090 --> 00:07:57,980
They say twenty minutes.

301
00:07:57,980 --> 00:07:59,070
I did thirty,

302
00:07:59,070 --> 00:08:00,320
twice a day,

303
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:02,960
lowest setting that first
week.

304
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,300
I put it on the calendar.

305
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:05,430
The first week,

306
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:06,220
I couldn't have told

307
00:08:06,220 --> 00:08:07,950
you if anything was
happening.

308
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:08,800
I tried not to get

309
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,890
