the rail.

315
00:08:17,390 --> 00:08:18,940
I hadn't decided to.

316
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:19,970
I just did it,

317
00:08:19,970 --> 00:08:21,270
then stopped halfway down

318
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:22,730
