block.

331
00:08:39,830 --> 00:08:40,840
And for the first time

332
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,000
in two years,

333
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,290
I said yes.

334
00:08:43,290 --> 00:08:44,940
I wanted to understand
why,

335
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:46,600
so I read the whole thing.

336
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,400
