surgery is over.

340
00:08:53,580 --> 00:08:54,290
Two.

341
00:08:54,290 --> 00:08:56,930
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

342
00:08:56,930 --> 00:08:57,840
so it takes up more

343
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,950
