344
00:08:58,950 --> 00:08:59,610
Three.

345
00:08:59,610 --> 00:09:01,240
There's only so much room
in there.

346
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,730
Bending compresses it.

347
00:09:02,730 --> 00:09:04,360
Straightening pulls it
tight.

348
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,720
That's the squeeze.

349
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,680
Four.

350
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:08,460
Red and near-infrared
light have been

351
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:10,700
studied for calming that
inflammation,

352
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:12,030
so the swelling and the
pressure

353
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,500
can come down with it.

354
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,220
In a randomized trial,

355
00:09:15,220 --> 00:09:17,400
patients given light
therapy after

356
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,630
