358
00:09:19,970 --> 00:09:21,030
less swelling

359
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:22,870
and better early movement
than

360
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,460
those who weren't.

361
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:27,400
A 2025 review said the
same,

362
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,760
and was clear the evidence

363
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:30,110
is still limited.

364
00:09:30,110 --> 00:09:31,540
I probably sound like a
broken

365
00:09:31,540 --> 00:09:32,370
