366
00:09:32,370 --> 00:09:33,590
on my crew.

367
00:09:33,590 --> 00:09:35,450
But after two years of
doing everything

368
00:09:35,450 --> 00:09:37,490
I was told and getting
nowhere,

369
00:09:37,490 --> 00:09:38,970
you have no idea what it's

370
00:09:38,970 --> 00:09:40,600
like to sleep through the
night,

371
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,020
say yes to the walk,

372
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:43,510
and get my life back.

373
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:44,960
So take it from me.

374
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,570
Don't spend another year
waiting

375
00:09:46,570 --> 00:09:47,770
